      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "* The Code Evaluation Service sees spikes during contest start and end. \nAnd the workers need to scale independently based on queue depth. \nDifferent traffic patterns, different scaling needs, different blast radius concerns.",
      "fontSize": 14.540625000000007,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "* The Code Evaluation Service sees spikes during contest start and end. \nAnd the workers need to scale independently based on queue depth. \nDifferent traffic patterns, different scaling needs, different blast radius concerns.",
